      "displayName": "Orison Platforms Under Attack",
      "titleSource": "localized_clean",
      "titleConfidence": "high",
      "briefing": "Greetings,\n\nCrusader Security Forces have contacted us seeking our expertise in dealing with an urgent situation. Several platforms near Orison have been overtaken by members of the Nine Tails gang and Northrock is eager to staff an operation to remove them and return the platforms to Crusader.\n\nThe Nine Tails have put measures in place to block all air traffic in the area, so we've been granted access to a secure shuttle that will take you, and any other members of your assault team, to the first platform.\n\nFor full disclosure, I must warn that this is not a contract for the faint of heart. I am confident though that your combat skills, you and your selected team will be fully up to the challenge. \n\nOnce you've arrived at the shuttle I'll be in touch directly with more information.\n\nSpeak more soon,\nAdrienne Du-Buisson\nLogistics Officer - Stanton Branch\nNorthrock Service Group",
